# Prebuilt SFML 2.5.1 is part of the repo on purpose: the solution builds
# right after cloning, with nothing to install.
!SFML/**/*.lib
!SFML/**/*.pdb
# openal32.dll must sit next to the exe for sound to work.
!EBLZ_ApplesGame_Dynamic/openal32.dll
